{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And the word שרשרות.</b> The ayin is doubled, and if they had not doubled it, it would equal שרשת גבלת (Exodus 28:22). And to explain in the language of the Holy Tongue the word גבלות, and many words, in the making of the choshen — also the word חשן is difficult:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:48.492565498Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}